379e2d8e|4|Aug, 2023|1|1|H|Value-for-money|This is my honest review of this product after using it for 4 months. (Note: You might notice a bit of scratches and stains on the picture attached but it's cause I'm using it since 4 months continuously, the product was delivered in perfect condition) Let me keep it simple for everyone. Design: The best thing I liked about these buds are that they come in this cute oval shape which easily fits into your pocket along with your phone. Easy to fit and easy to take out. Better than those cubical cases in my opinion. Sound: I'll give sound a 7/10. It's good enough for this price However at times I felt theres a sound problem but couldn't figure out if it was coming from the buds or the music (lol). Bass is also good. You can also adjust it from the mobile app Battery: Batter life is very satisfying. In these four months even after using it for days I never ran out of battery before I plugged it to charge. Touch Censors: The only disappointed was the touch censors whom I'd rate a 5/10 cause they don't catch the finger gestures. Not that its a problem just a hit or miss in my case. Microphone: The quality of the input audio is okayish. You get a better recording from those of wired earphones. Overall gave it a rating of 4 out of 5 stars and I think for this amount this is a total worth it product. I don't think I could have got a better pair of headset at this range. So would totally recommend to go for it.
