04102f4f|3|Apr, 2022|6|1|H|Just okay|Don't buy these, because it's a gamble on whether you get a good piece or get a defective one. Defects: QC on these is really bad. Left side's sound has suddenly gone significantly quieter than the right side. It has been barely 2 months, and the product has run into this issue. I had the same issue the first time I turned it on, but it fixed itself after resetting, but I can't seem to be able to reset it again, and it's annoying me. Problems: Why are the controls so unintuitive? When you wear these neckbands, the volume up button is at the bottom and volume down is at the top, what a wonderful design. Also, because there is the extra weight of the controls on the right side, compared to the left side, any kind of movement of the head rotates the earphones inside your ear, which makes it really unpleasant to have on. I would have given it an even lower rating, but other neckbands on the market are even worse, and there's nothing I can do about that. And don't even get me started on the "voice" of the neckband. It's so annoying, done just to "stand out". Everytime you turn it on, it goes "Power on, you've plugged into Nirvana. You've connected to boat Rockerzz." It says that second line twice if you've connected it to two devices. Also, the "mAxImUm/miNiMuM vOlUmE" voiceline is so over dramatic, like bro shut up. Also when shutting it down, it goes "Adios amigo, powering off..." So annoying, so much annoying. There is 0 simplicity and subtlety in this product. Also there's no aptX of any kind, and the even AAC is hard to maintain on certain phones, as it will keep resetting back to SBC, so false advertising at its finest. And sound quality? Lmao that's non existent... There's no bass... None at all... I have to max the bass slider in the Equalizer + turn bass boost to the max to get any semblance of listenable music. I bought this neckband just to have something to listen music on when I'm trying to focus and keep my phone as far as possible, but it's such a finicky and irritating product. I regret my decision of buying these everytime I pick these up. Would not recommend at all.
