97a4e082|3|Oct, 2024|2|1|H|Fair|Packaging:- the speaker was delivered in a cardboard packaging by Flipkart, which was compact and nice, however the actual box of the speaker was a little damaged and might have been a returned item by some other customer. 2. Look:- the boat Stone 190 pro speaker is a cute little compact peacock blue coloured speaker. I liked the look and feel of the product. It is quite lightweight. 3. Sound:- the sound is a bit muffled at low volume. At higher volume, it gives a bit more clarity. 4. Bass:- very low. Probably no bass. 5. Connectivity:- bluetooth connectivity is very good, with a good range. However aux cable connection is faulty. 6. Battery:- after full charge for the first time, I have used the product at 50% volume for 2.5 hours, and have seen only 10% battery drop. So initial battery support seems to be okay. 7. Final verdict:- ok product for daily use. No bass, less clarity, however loudness is good. Okay for a small room.
