63dd6602|4|Oct, 2020|5460|1|H|Nice product|Pros: 1.Charging time with 18W charger is 7 hours. With 10 watt charger it takes 10.5 hours to charge completely. (If your charger is 15W , it will still take 10.5 hours to charge). 2. It doesn't have a power on/off button. There is a battery level indicater button on side. When you press it once, it will show the battery level remaining. If you press it twice, it will go on low- current discharge mode when you can charge devices like Bluetooth headphones and smartbands. When you connect/disconnect the device to power bank, it automatically detects it. So there is no need for power on/off button. 3. One USB type C input/output port is present. So power bank is future proof. Apart from that there is another micro USB input port. There are 2 USB Type A output port. 4. USB A to type C cable is present in the box. 5. It comes with anti counterfeit label. You can check the authenticity of power bank by entering 20 digit anti-counterfeit security code on chaxun.mi.com. 6. Build quality is very good. Sandstone design looks premium. 7. Flipkart delivery is very good. I received the power bank within 36 hours. Cons : 1. Only 18W input/output is supported at max. So charging time is still on the higher side . Today, we are using 25+ watt charger in Android smartphones. They can not be used to fast charge the power bank. 2. Only 10W and 18W input charging is supported. If your adapter is 15W, it will still charge at 10W. Please don't leave the power bank in completely charged or discharged state for a very long period. It will affect the battery life. Also don't drain the battery to 0% before charging again. When battery drops to 50%-25% level, charge the power bank. It will help maintain the battery life.
