7b7c28df|1|3 days ago|0|1|N|Worst experience ever!|Disappointed! Overheating, Constant Hissing, &amp; Poor Fit for Small Ears I bought these Realme Buds T310 looking forward to the specs, but the real-world performance is highly disappointing. &bull; Major Heating Issue: Within just a few minutes of putting them in, the earbuds start heating up noticeably. It feels highly unsafe to keep them inside the ear. &bull; Constant Hissing Sound: Whenever the music is paused or off, there is a very annoying, constant technical hiss/static sound in the background. It ruins the experience. &bull; Terrible for Small Ears: The earbud head size is bulky and poorly designed for small ears. It doesn't fit securely and becomes physically uncomfortable and painful within minutes. &bull; Subpar Sound Quality: Given the price tag, the audio performance is just not up to the mark. Honestly, my older Boult earbuds offer much better sound clarity, deeper bass, and superior overall performance at a similar or lower price. I am thoroughly unsatisfied with this purchase. I will definitely update my review after a few months of use if things change, but right now, I wouldn't recommend them&mdash;especially if you have smaller ears!
