f6015264|4|Oct, 2024|14|1|H|WORTH IT|the delivery and first impressions were good .The packaging was fine , but the moment i connected it to my phone and started listening i noticed that the music tilted slightly towards the right side. Which meant that one earbud had lower volume than the other . I thought maybe my phone was the problem so i tired connecting to my laptop , but after turning on the dual device connection it was simply not popping up on the bluetooth window . after 10 minutes i somehow managed to connect the earbuds with my laptop . but still the issue of the sound tilting towards the persisted . i let my friend try and he said the same thing too . i then contacted flipkart customer service and was instructed to contact the realme service centre, i did but still the issue was not solved , so i went to a service centre , the staff noticed it too and filed for a replacement. NOW I HAVE TO WAIT FOR MORE 5 DAYS EDIT- after getting the replacement and after 6 months of constant usage, i can say that the sound quality is top notch . the left and right separations is well. talking about bass , its good and balanced . neither too high , thumping , bass nor too low . and the app support works fine , you can easily switch between different presets and modes acc to your needs . now coming to the noise cancellation , its good , cancels out some noise but does have a white noise issue when turned on . overall its a good investment . i am changing it from 2 to 4 stars
