21ae9cab|5|Sep, 2022|5189|1|H|Awesome|1. Clear sound quality with extreme loudness(I didn't use it above 50% volume indoor) 2. Great bass ( I used oppo enco buds and bot rockerz 255 pro + but this earbuds sounds way more better) 3. Battery backup : 6.5 hrs for earbuds , takes 60min for earbuds and 1.5 hr for case to get completely charge. No indication to understand case charging. 4. Touch controls: not that much fast but works perfectly. 5. App supports: gives 3 modes , bass boosted , balence and clear vocals.case charging u can check here only! 6. Build : easily get scratch , hinge quality is good , both case and earbuds are slippery (i fall earbuds 2 - 3 times but no problem at all yet) . Earbuds are light weight and perfectly fit into ear , and cut down surrounding sound as well you can easily notice difference . 7. Connectivity: super fast and reliable. Very few times got disconnected but again pairing is extremely smooth and fast. 8. No latency at all while watching movies(not sure for pro-gammers) 9.No dual pairing available. 10. Call quality is ok.
